  m_Name: Bulwark
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 10
  moveSpeed: 0.9
  scoreValue: 200
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A knight who knelt behind his tower shield and never found a reason
    to stand again. The host stopped waiting.
  tactics: High HP, slow descent, no attack; pure blockade. Behind one there is usually
    something shooting - a Warden's homing bolts curve around it. Either commit to
    breaking the wall fast or hold your fire and slip around; half-measures waste
    your damage into iron while the escort works.
